Package: TimeSCapeR
Title: Circadian Rhythm Detection from Single-Cell RNA-Seq Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Translation", "Claude", email = "claude@anthropic.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Description: TimeSCape v0.2 translated from MATLAB to R. Detects circadian rhythms
  in single-cell expression data through cosinor fitting, statistical testing,
  and interactive visualization. Provides command-line pipeline (run_timescape)
  and web-based GUI (Shiny app).
License: MIT
